sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Seller app
  participant DB as Supabase
  participant B as Buyer web
  S->>DB: create product/drop (RLS)
  S->>DB: set approved drop live
  B->>DB: public views / live catalog
  B->>DB: create_order_with_reservation
  B->>DB: initiate attempt + submit claim
  S->>DB: verify/reject claim RPC
  DB-->>B: order/payment Realtime or token lookup
  S->>DB: ready_to_ship / shipped RPC
